WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
You think about being back home, it's all
dark skin.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.620
So if you're not dark skin, you're white.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.280
And just like how I said in the UK,

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:09.340
if you're not white, you're black type
thing.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:10.700
So it's the roles with her.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.260
So I had that real kind of dialogue with
myself.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.180
This was back in 2018 and it was a bit
confusing.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.980
I was like, I didn't like it.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:17.780
It made me feel uncomfortable.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.400
And it started making me question things.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.940
And then I went back the year after,

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.320
and I understood things a bit better.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:23.840
And I understood, look, at the end of the
day,

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.700
you're mixed race, you are what you are.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:26.500
Your mum's white.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.780
You've got a white side of the family.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.360
but you experience in the UK very
different.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.620
So yeah, I could go and run the houses,

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.440
but yeah, with this character idea,

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.740
I could completely connect with that
identity crisis

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.940
that he's going through.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.180
So yeah, it was great to be involved in.
